{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.mp4?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape a mine overrun by zombie miners.\u00a0</strong>Explore dark tunnels, fight infected workers, collect diamonds and repair escape vehicles before night turns the mine into a nightmare.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each run lasts 15\u201320 minutes. Nothing is ever in the same place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/46a942957487a2350d61a95c76221195.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed65971c34d8882ececc69c655411ea7.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed65971c34d8882ececc69c655411ea7.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The miners are no longer human.\u00a0</strong>Many still carry their <strong>tools</strong>, but now they use them to hunt you. Fight through narrow tunnels and survive relentless attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/fcfb5cb326c544803213e2b2d5dd57b6.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.mp4?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day is dangerous.\u00a0<strong>Night is far worse.\u00a0</strong>When darkness falls, enemies become <strong>faster, more aggressive and harder to stop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/8c70d96f45c9e2c99b8801638fb47277.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ab8c8b3317022ef78254167eeabe44df.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ab8c8b3317022ef78254167eeabe44df.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ab8c8b3317022ef78254167eeabe44df.mp4?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape vehicles and important items <strong>spawn in different places every run</strong>. You must explore, adapt and find the best route before it's too late. Weapons break. Death is permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/de37137b1607acf9a4961710c692c939.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/6f930cb3f50f2d80f67e51c431a9f1d7.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamonds are the most valuable resource in the mine.\u00a0</strong>Spend them on powerful rewards, upgrades, or even another chance after death.\u00a0<strong>But every choice has a cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/530488173c499d6335fc6f6a61f0282f.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/99cb9b5fa150c71cdd15f2f35a4331a4.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/99cb9b5fa150c71cdd15f2f35a4331a4.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/99cb9b5fa150c71cdd15f2f35a4331a4.mp4?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some workers mutated into something far worse. Stronger. Bigger. Almost unstoppable.\u00a0</strong>Facing them may be the only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/53c91716a022742794a5d8ede97e401b.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b59b9775c46da7bd02b03202821e8fd8.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rare chests hidden in the mine can completely change a run. Their <strong>contents and prices change every time</strong>, making each attempt unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/0fd6b93a669e0c4de4f10256a5e90ceb.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b5c7653ddfabb84ed7ef35a095e03382.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b5c7653ddfabb84ed7ef35a095e03382.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b5c7653ddfabb84ed7ef35a095e03382.mp4?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple escape routes exist inside the mine. Some runs will be fast. Others will become desperate fights for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strategy, luck and the diamonds you find to escape. Or remain trapped forever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968460?t=1774740259","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/a3a234ca845ac457b10b21a32721e5a025e4c8d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774740259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/164fa5e3b44315b84cb7adbcaa2e3f8c217639ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774740259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/164fa5e3b44315b84cb7adbcaa2e3f8c217639ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774740259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.mp4?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape a mine overrun by zombie miners.\u00a0</strong>Explore dark tunnels, fight infected workers, collect diamonds and repair escape vehicles before night turns the mine into a nightmare.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each run lasts 15\u201320 minutes. Nothing is ever in the same place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/46a942957487a2350d61a95c76221195.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed65971c34d8882ececc69c655411ea7.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed65971c34d8882ececc69c655411ea7.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The miners are no longer human.\u00a0</strong>Many still carry their <strong>tools</strong>, but now they use them to hunt you. Fight through narrow tunnels and survive relentless attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/fcfb5cb326c544803213e2b2d5dd57b6.avif?t=1774740259\" width=600 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.poster.avif?t=1774740259\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.webm?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.mp4?t=1774740259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day 